{"id":"ne94ca71565","headline":"Reopening of strait \"very fragile\", PM says","summary":"Dozens of oil tankers are heading to Australia through the Strait of Hormuz as an international reopening of the waterway is described as very fragile by the prime minister.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz is a key chokepoint through which a large share of seaborne oil passes, so disruptions there affect global crude supply and prices.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"energy-supply","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Strait of Hormuz","country":"Oman","lat":26.56,"lon":56.25,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"wellingtontimes.com.au","url":"https://www.wellingtontimes.com.au/story/9226816/reopening-of-strait-very-fragile-pm-says/"},"sources":[{"name":"wellingtontimes.com.au","url":"https://www.wellingtontimes.com.au/story/9226816/reopening-of-strait-very-fragile-pm-says/"}],"published_at":"2026-04-18T02:08:58Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"d3ed854901c4da78","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Reopening of the strait is described as fragile, and dozens of oil tankers are on their way through it. The uncertainty over shipping flows supports oil price volatility.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-04-18T02:08:58Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-04-18T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-3140155.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit":"adege","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/motor-tanker-cargo-ship-invest-3140155/"}}